flowchart TB
  subgraph A[Phase A — metadata preparation]
    direction LR
    DB[Official Sakila<br/>MySQL · fixed records] --> DH[DataHub Core<br/>ingestion + annotations]
    DH --> CLIENT[MCP server + Python client<br/>raw retrieval receipts]
    CLIENT --> SNAP[S0 · S1 · S2 · S3 snapshots<br/>validation + SHA-256]
  end
  subgraph B[Phase B — controlled experiment]
    direction LR
    Q[30 Indonesian questions<br/>10 simple · 10 medium · 10 complex] --> BUILD[Fixed prompt builder]
    BUILD --> LLM[One local LLM<br/>independent request]
    LLM --> EXEC[AST policy + read-only MySQL]
    EXEC --> CMP[Execution-result comparator]
    GOLD[Isolated gold SQL + result contract] --> CMP
    CMP --> ANALYSIS[Ledger + paired analysis<br/>EX · effects · uncertainty]
  end
  A -->|Frozen metadata only| B
  classDef prep fill:#eaf2f8,stroke:#335c81,color:#19334b;
  classDef run fill:#edf5ee,stroke:#4c7853,color:#213d26;
  class DB,DH,CLIENT,SNAP prep;
  class Q,BUILD,LLM,EXEC,CMP,GOLD,ANALYSIS run;
